{"id":"01a06586-0a07-7fc3-89da-25dcf401f73d","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":954,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holderSlug":"captain-rasea","holderQuote":"She pointed at her mast. Everyone looked up. The flag hung beneath her colors. Wil nodded slowly. And Captain Rasea swept her hat from her head."}
{"id":"01a06586-0a07-7734-97c1-d81128fb8aca","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":979,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holderSlug":"captain-rasea","holderQuote":"Chaos and confusion. And at the heart of it—Wil Kallinad and his friends. He saw Captain Lasc moving backwards across the deck, dueling Captain Rasea Zecrew."}
{"id":"01a06586-0a07-702d-b5b2-1923d74a893b","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":987,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holderSlug":"captain-rasea","holderQuote":"Rasea whirled as Venaz charged her from the left. She slashed and the Minotaur halted. She ducked as Peki kicked at her head; she was too fast! And her body lit up in a flash."}
{"id":"01a06586-0a07-78b4-9ea8-00371c3acb48","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":1103,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holderSlug":"captain-rasea","holderQuote":"Eight landed on the deck, scattering [Storm Sailors]. Lord Seagrass stared as Rasea the Shining pulled her hat out of her bag of holding. His warship was the largest ship on the sea bar none. Hundreds of [Storm Sailors] for each of the [Pirates]. But more [Pirate] and Drowned Ships were sailing on his ship."}
{"id":"01a06586-0a07-76ad-8698-3e4198f0f890","chapterSlug":"rwInterlude - Strategists at Sea (Pt- 2)","paragraph":1228,"wording":"[Pirate Captain]","event":"named","holderSlug":"captain-rasea","holderQuote":"Captain Rasea Zecrew crowed. She grinned; she’d swung off her ship again! She reached down—and a fake Wil tackled her. The [Pirate Captain] cursed."}
